A description keeps a block at its body column whatever leads the item

````
- :: term
  : definition

    ```
    code
    ```
after
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <dl>
      <dt>term</dt>
      <dd>
        <p>definition</p>
        <pre><code>code
</code></pre>
      </dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>after</p>
````

